L["ONBOARD_STEP_1_TITLE"] = "Turn a second display into your Offhand"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_1_BODY"] = "Offhand keeps the 3D world on your Mainhand monitor and gives ordinary windows, such as the map, bags and character panel, a separate workspace. This guide prepares Windows, WoW and your chosen spanning method first. The calibration wizard follows after the span is verified.\n\nClosing this guide does not mark setup complete; it will return next login until you reach the calibration step."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_2_TITLE"] = "Choose how to span WoW"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_2_BODY"] = "On Windows, we recommend the Microsoft Store Companion for exact monitor geometry and borderless placement.\n\nFancyZones remains an option for an existing PowerToys setup. Manual resizing works on any platform. Portable Companion builds are available for Linux/Wine.\n\nChoose the method you will use to place WoW, then continue calibration."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_3_TITLE"] = "Prepare Windows and WoW"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_3_BODY"] = "1. Arrange displays in Windows exactly as they sit on your desk and align their shared edge.\n2. In WoW, choose Windowed mode, not Windowed (Fullscreen).\n3. FancyZones: create one Canvas zone covering the intended combined window and snap WoW into it.\n4. Companion: select the displays and Mainhand, then use Span WoW Now.\n5. Manual: drag and resize WoW across the displays or over the ultrawide region yourself."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_4_TITLE"] = "Span WoW and verify the layout"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_4_BODY"] = "Place the Windowed WoW client using the method you selected. FancyZones and manual placement use the same safe confirmation: click Next to remember the current canvas, then calibrate the seam and Mainhand region.\n\nCompanion users should click Span WoW Now and Reload UI so Offhand can read its exact topology. Known incompatible Companion versions and stale exact topology remain blocked."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_5_TITLE"] = "Prepare your in-game layout"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_5_BODY"] = "Retail protects action bars and other combat controls through Blizzard Edit Mode. The calibration wizard ends with Create Mainhand HUD Layout. Press it outside combat with Edit Mode closed; Offhand will create and select a Mainhand-safe copy, then ask you to reload.\n\nThe disabled button below is a visual preview. After setup, the same action remains available in Offhand Monitor > Recovery & Preview whenever the generated layout needs to be refreshed or rebuilt."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_5_BODY_FOREVER"] = "Forever protects action bars, party/raid frames and other combat controls through Blizzard Edit Mode. The calibration wizard ends with Create Mainhand HUD Layout. Press it outside combat with Edit Mode closed; Offhand will preserve custom placements, arrange the standard HUD controls on Mainhand, and ask you to reload.\n\nThe disabled button below is a visual preview. After setup, the same action remains available in Offhand Monitor > Recovery & Preview whenever the generated layout needs to be refreshed or rebuilt."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_5_BODY_EDITMODE"] = "This client manages action bars and other protected combat controls through Blizzard Edit Mode. The calibration wizard ends with Create Mainhand HUD Layout. Press it outside combat with Edit Mode closed; Offhand will create and select a Mainhand-safe copy, then ask you to reload.\n\nThe disabled button below is a visual preview. After setup, the same action remains available in Offhand Monitor > Recovery & Preview whenever the generated layout needs to be refreshed or rebuilt."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_5_TITLE_NO_EDITMODE"] = "Classic interface preparation"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_5_BODY_NO_EDITMODE"] = "This client does not expose Blizzard's modern Edit Mode layout system, so no generated Mainhand HUD layout is required. The calibration wizard will finish after UI size is confirmed.\n\nAfter calibration, place ordinary movable windows such as the map, bags, and character panel on the Offhand workspace. Offhand will preserve their supported positions and visibility."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_6_TITLE"] = "Ready for display calibration"
L["ONBOARD_STEP_6_BODY"] = "The installation checks are complete. Continue into the calibration wizard to confirm monitor orientation, the physical seam, Mainhand aspect ratio and UI size. On Forever and Retail, its final step creates and selects the required Mainhand HUD layout; setup is recorded as complete only after that succeeds.\n\nYou can reopen this guide later from /offhand guide or the Help tab."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_6_BODY_NO_EDITMODE"] = "The installation checks are complete. Continue into the four-step calibration wizard to confirm monitor orientation, the physical seam, Mainhand aspect ratio and UI size. This client does not require a generated Blizzard Edit Mode layout, so finishing UI-size calibration completes setup.\n\nYou can reopen this guide later from /offhand guide or the Help tab."
L["ONBOARD_STEP_6_BODY_EDITMODE"] = "The installation checks are complete. Continue into the calibration wizard to confirm monitor orientation, the physical seam, Mainhand aspect ratio and UI size. Because this client exposes Blizzard Edit Mode, the final step creates and selects the required Mainhand HUD layout; setup is fully ready after that succeeds.\n\nYou can reopen this guide later from /offhand guide or the Help tab."
